        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Performed the following steps:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Created <code class=\"notranslate\">css/how_to</code> and a <code class=\"notranslate\">how_to/index.md</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Moved <code class=\"notranslate\">layout_cookbook</code> under <code class=\"notranslate\">how_to</code>:<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">yarn content move Web/CSS/Layout_cookbook Web/CSS/How_to/Layout_cookbook</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To update the slug casing from \"Layout_cookbook/Breadcrumb_Navigation\" to \"Layout_cookbook/Breadcrumb_navigation\":</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Updated the slug casing in the front matter.</li>\n<li>Updated the redirect using:<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">yarn content add-redirect /en-US/docs/Web/CSS/How_to/Layout_cookbook/Breadcrumb_Navigation /en-US/docs/Web/CSS/How_to/Layout_cookbook/Breadcrumb_navigation</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Same steps to update the slug casing from \"Layout_cookbook/Split_Navigation\" to \"Layout_cookbook/Split_navigation\".</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated all links using <code class=\"notranslate\">node scripts/update-moved-file-links.js</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated page-types to <code class=\"notranslate\">how-to</code> (except for contribute and cookbook template).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated <code class=\"notranslate\">cssref.yaml</code> to:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the \"How to\" section to the sidebar.</li>\n<li>Add contribute and cookbook template to the sidebar.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Before and after</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Current structure:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"files/en-us/web/css/\n├── layout_cookbook\n         ├── breadcrumb_navigation\n         ├── card\n         ├── center_an_element\n         ├── column_layouts\n         ├── contribute_a_recipe\n         |    └── cookbook_template\n         ├── grid_wrapper\n         ├── list_group_with_badges\n         ├── media_objects\n         ├── pagination\n         ├── split_navigation\n         └── sticky_footers\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/\n├── layout_cookbook\n         ├── breadcrumb_navigation\n         ├── card\n         ├── center_an_element\n         ├── column_layouts\n         ├── contribute_a_recipe\n         |    └── cookbook_template\n         ├── grid_wrapper\n         ├── list_group_with_badges\n         ├── media_objects\n         ├── pagination\n         ├── split_navigation\n         └── sticky_footers\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After the move:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"files/en-us/web/css/how_to\n├── layout_cookbook\n         ├── breadcrumb_navigation\n         ├── card\n         ├── center_an_element\n         ├── column_layouts\n         ├── contribute_a_recipe\n         |    └── cookbook_template\n         ├── grid_wrapper\n         ├── list_group_with_badges\n         ├── media_objects\n         ├── pagination\n         ├── split_navigation\n         └── sticky_footers\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/how_to\n├── layout_cookbook\n         ├── breadcrumb_navigation\n         ├── card\n         ├── center_an_element\n         ├── column_layouts\n         ├── contribute_a_recipe\n         |    └── cookbook_template\n         ├── grid_wrapper\n         ├── list_group_with_badges\n         ├── media_objects\n         ├── pagination\n         ├── split_navigation\n         └── sticky_footers\n</code></pre></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Sidebar(currently)</th>\n<th>Sidebar (after the move)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/506808121-73bfaf84-29a3-47ea-a5fe-e97573094e01.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Jn9cCP_n5RMgp2SZov4OzuGkKJJHkBaiIc0xQBquyEU\"><img width=\"329\" height=\"453\" alt=\"layout cookbook sidebar before the move\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/506808121-73bfaf84-29a3-47ea-a5fe-e97573094e01.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Jn9cCP_n5RMgp2SZov4OzuGkKJJHkBaiIc0xQBquyEU\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 453px;\"></a></kbd></td>\n<td><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/506808125-02218f3d-4989-4732-a09c-501fd3371e33.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..4_V0S1-ihpQNeLVTSWaUHl9fAartDj6CJ9FgihPVtqA\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"569\" alt=\"layout cookbook sidebar after the move\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/506808125-02218f3d-4989-4732-a09c-501fd3371e33.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..4_V0S1-ihpQNeLVTSWaUHl9fAartDj6CJ9FgihPVtqA\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 569px;\"></a></kbd></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Discussion: <a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/256\">https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/256</a><br>\nTracker issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2978311041\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/662\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/662/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/662\">mdn/mdn#662</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To check the proposed new structure, see: <a href=\"https://github.com/dipikabh/mdn-css-reorg/blob/main/css-tree-proposed.json\">https://github.com/dipikabh/mdn-css-reorg/blob/main/css-tree-proposed.json</a></p>",
